abstract: >
  An interactive 0-D educational simulator that links CO₂ emissions,
  rainfall change, urbanization, and green infrastructure to local
  flood and drought risk indices in London. Designed for the Great
  Exhibition Road Festival (Imperial College London) and as a teaching
  tool for environmental engineering courses.
